msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask"
msgid "Extra filtering parameter of type FMaskFilter. This filter allows us to refine queries (channel, object) with an additional level of ignore by tagging entire classes of objects."
msgstr "Extra filtering parameter of type FMaskFilter. This filter allows us to refine queries (channel, object) with an additional level of ignore by tagging entire classes of objects."

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
