msgid "Hillholder holds the brake when the vehicle travel direction is against the current gear. It's only activated if the speed of the vehicle is below this value. Zero means disabled."
msgstr "Hillholder holds the brake when the vehicle travel direction is against the current gear. It's only activated if the speed of the vehicle is below this value. Zero means disabled."

