#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed"
msgid "Pacejka tire model does not work well at low speeds. When the velocity gets too small the calculations get problematic so tires can slide slowly on a slope even if the vehicle is fully stopped. This is an experimental hacky solution to solve this issue. When the vehicles velocity is below this speed(kmh) the tires will switch to sticky state. If you keep this value at 0 then it is disabled."
msgstr "Pacejka tire model does not work well at low speeds. When the velocity gets too small the calculations get problematic so tires can slide slowly on a slope even if the vehicle is fully stopped. This is an experimental hacky solution to solve this issue. When the vehicles velocity is below this speed(kmh) the tires will switch to sticky state. If you keep this value at 0 then it is disabled."

